#5700
The Pyramid of the Serpent~
This area (5701-5784) forms the first level of the Pyramid of the Serpent.

Zone 58 forms the other 4 levels(each level is smaller than the previous one).
It is inhabited by a race of serpent people and a variety of deadly reptiles
(especially snakes). The first two levels are a maze, there are a number of
traps, ambushes and secret doors in the maze intended to make it difficult to
explore. The area should be quite challenging and I expect people to go here
grouped. A thief will definitely be neccessary to pick doors and negotiate
any traps the party falls into.

The connection points are as follows:
Down of 5782 is connected to 5071 (This is the entrance to the area)
Up of 5783 is connected to 5825
Up of 5784 is connected to 5807

This area was written by Vex.
~
